  "details": "1. Open Vrchat\n\n2. log in\n\n3. Attempt to join/or request to join friend on vr platform or pc user\n\n4. \"You are trying to join an instance which is not compatible with your current client, please update VrChat and try again.\"\n\nSummary: I have the latest version, me and my friends all do, we cannot join each other, this problem persists on both the QUEST 2 and PC SteamVR versions.",
